    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The spirit of the dragon takes root within you, its influence enduring whether you wear its form or your own.</p><p><strong>Acidic Touch.</strong> Each of your attacks in a Wild Shape form can deal its normal damage type or Acid damage. You make this choice each time you hit with those attacks.</p><p><strong>Water Dweller.</strong> You gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed.</p><p><strong>Maturing Wyrm Spirit.</strong> You no longer have the Wyrmling exception in your Dragon Soul feature.</p>"
